          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, justice Alito questioned whether statements by the attorney general reflected hostility toward Islam."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90e3c01ef6654550bb985f24f6a673251334ce0647976c74322dfb3e9bd9e6f6",
