        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the statements were motivated by the Blaine movement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90e3c01ef6654550bb985f24f6a673251334ce0647976c74322dfb3e9bd9e6f6",
            "evidence_ids": [
